----
1. mcopt (Apache License 2.0)

Cadence is a modified version of mcopt (https://github.com/noahdunnagan/mcopt, upstream commit 7b1d0fb). Its original
NOTICE follows, unchanged:

    mcopt
    Copyright 2026 Noah Dunnagan

    mcopt, a Minecraft mod, was created by Noah Dunnagan. If you use or redistribute this code, keep this NOTICE with it
    and credit mcopt (https://github.com/noahdunnagan/mcopt).

    mcopt is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

Changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): Cadence renamed mcopt's packages, mod ids, configuration names and messages to
Cadence, and added and changed much else. Source files that came from mcopt carry the line
"Cadence: derived from mcopt (c) Noah Dunnagan, Apache-2.0; modified." as their first line. docs/CHANGES-FROM-MCOPT.md lists what
Cadence changed or added relative to mcopt commit 7b1d0fb (it is written with the old names; docs/LICENSING.md maps them to
the new ones).

