2. Minecraft Shader Loader / minecraft-metal-renderer (MIT License)

Cadence includes code adapted from minecraft-metal-renderer by Kausik Velaga
(https://github.com/Kausik-Velaga/minecraft-metal-renderer, upstream commit c609745),
Copyright (c) 2026 Minecraft Metal Renderer contributors, under the MIT License (shaders/LICENSE-MIT-shader-loader):
the whole shaders module (its Shader Loader and scene layer, now "Cadence Shaders"), and in the metal module
MetalPassHints, MetalPipelineMath and SpirvMathPolicy. Source files that came from it carry the line
"Cadence: derived from Minecraft Shader Loader (c) Minecraft Metal Renderer contributors, MIT; modified." (the three
metal files carry their own "Adapted from" header). The MIT copyright notice and permission notice are kept in
shaders/LICENSE-MIT-shader-loader and are included in the jars that contain this code.

